The constructor at line 350–361 sets:

```ts
const username = os.userInfo().username;
this.socketPath = `/tmp/tauri-mcp-o8-${username}.sock`;
this.tokenPath = `${this.socketPath}.token`;
```

The socket path template is **`` `/tmp/tauri-mcp-o8-${username}.sock` ``**, where `username` is sourced from `os.userInfo().username` at runtime. A companion token path is derived as the same string with `.token` appended.
